{
  "$comment": [
    "Configuración compartida del proyecto (se versiona).",
    "Los ajustes personales van en .claude/settings.local.json, que está",
    "en .gitignore: así cada persona ajusta lo suyo sin tocar el repo.",
    "Las reglas del runner llevan ':*' desde v0.1.80: acepta patrones de",
    "selección, y la forma de coincidencia exacta pediría permiso para",
    "cualquier `tests/_runner.py transient`."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(python tests/_runner.py:*)",
      "Bash(QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen python tests/_runner.py:*)",
      "Bash(python -m ogr_cli:*)",
      "Bash(git status)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(grep:*)",
      "Bash(rg:*)",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(find:*)"
    ],
    "ask": [
      "Bash(pip install:*)",
      "Bash(git commit:*)",
      "Bash(git push:*)",
      "Bash(rm:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Read(./.env)",
      "Read(./.env.*)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard:*)"
    ]
  },
  "env": {
    "QT_QPA_PLATFORM": "offscreen"
  }
}
